WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:03.050
- President Trump and his
allies have lost 59 lawsuits

00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:04.520
alleging election fraud.

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:06.470
However, that hasn't stopped
the President or his fans

00:00:06.470 --> 00:00:09.184
from propagating totally
insane conspiracy theories

00:00:09.184 --> 00:00:10.874
involving dead communist leaders

00:00:10.874 --> 00:00:13.620
and the voting machines who loved them.

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:15.070
Unfortunately, for President Trump,

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:17.200
this information is false.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.740
But you can imagine that perpetrating

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:22.100
the falsity of these facts
is really bad for business

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.030
if you are Dominion or Smartmatics,

00:00:24.030 --> 00:00:26.830
some of the manufacturers of
some of these voting machines.

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:28.570
But could this be one of the rare cases

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:30.441
of honest to goodness defamation?

00:00:30.441 --> 00:00:31.970
Well, maybe.

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:34.100
And Smartmatic and Dominion
are filing lawsuits

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:36.010
worth billions of dollars.

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:38.160
But before we continue,
there are obviously

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:39.767
some wild accusations being made,

00:00:39.767 --> 00:00:42.030
and there are billions
of dollars at stake.

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:43.220
And we here at Legal Eagle

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:45.398
take these accusations very seriously.

00:00:45.398 --> 00:00:48.320
In fact, Smeagol at the
Legal Eagle legal department

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:50.390
is forcing me to display this disclaimer.

00:00:50.390 --> 00:00:51.860
Please read it carefully.

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:54.390
By continuing with this
video, you agree to be bound

00:00:54.390 --> 00:00:56.013
by the terms and conditions.

